sceneconf(){Animation Test, normal}

host(){Welcome to the animatest project.This scenario exercises the test of cine animation.}
playanima(loop,5){testcine}
waitanima{}
host(){Could you see the 5 sec animation?That is great.}
host(){Now let's try playing animation while advancing the story.}
playanima(once,8){testfull}
host(){This is the first line while animation plays.}
host(){The animation runs in the background.}
host(){You can see both animation and dialog together.}
host(){The dialog area is protected from being overwritten.}
host(){Let's continue with the story after this.}
scene(end)
